1845	1862	1842	1843	the doctor	-1	“ do n’t be an old fool ; that was because your father kept good cider . ”
1898	1905	1891	1891	she	-1	“ that tells the whole story ! ”
1912	1918	1920	1922	the old lady	-1	“ Asummer house , hey ! ”
1948	1972	1933	1933	she	-1	“ a summer house ! that ’s the way the money goes , is it ? What have we here ? a book ; ”
